// Multiset[T]: a set that counts repeated elements (a bag).
//
// Like `#[T]`, but each element has a count: adding an element twice keeps two of it. Usually a map
// from element to count. Useful for word and letter counts, histograms, inventories, and checking
// whether two lists hold the same elements regardless of order.
//
// I'm implementing this one myself. Please leave this file as is.
//
